{"displayStem":"그림은 남길 간 구역의 연결을 단순화했다. 절제 계획대로 진행하면 X로 표시한 통로만 막히고 나머지 연결은 유지된다.","notes":[{"kind":"provenance","text":"교육용 가상 자료"}],"evidenceMarkup":["<div class=\"dataset-evidence batch-C05 c05-batch\"><div class=\"evidence c05-figure\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 620 360\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"독립 제작 구조 모식도\"><rect width=\"620\" height=\"360\" fill=\"white\"></rect><g font-family=\"Noto Sans CJK KR, sans-serif\" fill=\"black\"><rect x=\"220\" y=\"85\" width=\"195\" height=\"155\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"black\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></rect><text x=\"250\" y=\"165\" font-size=\"22\">남길 구역</text><path d=\"M35 115L215 115\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"black\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></path><path d=\"M215 115L205.99552897647322 119.3496553411123\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"black\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></path><path d=\"M215 115L205.99552897647322 110.6503446588877\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"black\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></path><text x=\"20\" y=\"78\" font-size=\"20\">문맥 유입</text><path d=\"M35 210L215 210\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"black\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></path><path d=\"M215 210L205.99552897647322 214.3496553411123\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"black\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></path><path d=\"M215 210L205.99552897647322 205.6503446588877\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"black\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></path><text x=\"20\" y=\"260\" font-size=\"20\">동맥 유입</text><path d=\"M420 115L570 115\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"black\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></path><path d=\"M570 115L560.9955289764732 119.3496553411123\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"black\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></path><path d=\"M570 115L560.9955289764732 110.6503446588877\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"black\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></path><text x=\"450\" y=\"75\" font-size=\"20\">간정맥 유출</text><text x=\"500\" y=\"160\" font-size=\"22\">X</text><path d=\"M505 105L525 125\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"black\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></path><path d=\"M505 125L525 105\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"black\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></path><path d=\"M42